
# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.1.0] - 2026-03-03

### Added
- Project architecture setup (MVVM + Clean Architecture)
- Hilt dependency injection configuration
- Room database with Trip, RoutePoint, and Alert entities
- OBD-II Bluetooth connection manager (ELM327 protocol)
- Phone sensor reader (accelerometer + gyroscope)
- Sensor fusion engine combining OBD-II and phone data
- Dashboard screen with real-time speed gauge
- Connection screen with Bluetooth device scanning
- Trip history screen with driving scores
- Trip detail screen with score breakdown
- Settings screen with configurable thresholds
- Profile screen with aggregate statistics
- Speed monitoring use case with configurable limits
- Harsh braking detection use case
- Fatigue monitoring use case (progressive alerts at 90/120/150 min)
- Driving score calculation algorithm (weighted: speed 30%, braking 25%, acceleration 20%, duration 15%, fuel 10%)
- Alert notification system with sound and vibration
- Foreground service for background data collection
- Material 3 theming with light/dark mode support
- Navigation with Jetpack Compose Navigation
- Unit tests for driving score and fatigue monitoring
- GitHub Actions CI pipeline
- Project documentation (README, CONTRIBUTING, CHANGELOG)

## [Unreleased]

### Planned
- Live map view with route tracking
- Google Places API integration for rest stop suggestions
- Trip route replay on map
- Export trip data as PDF report
- Widget for home screen speed display
- Turkish language localization improvements
